Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 13:19:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] test(driver): add terminal-session HDR proof paths

Add WGC value capture and a compile-time remote-driver first-arrival HDR experiment so the two surviving hypotheses can be tested deterministically. Propagate proof intent through leases and descriptors and log the exact initial manifest without changing default builds or mutating Windows components. Focused tests cover the protocol, state propagation, and probe contracts.

